<title>SRI LANKA: S.Lanka Jan-May coconut output up 2.5 pct on yr.</title>
<headline>S.Lanka Jan-May coconut output up 2.5 pct on yr.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lankan coconut production rose 2.5 percent year-on-year to 1.06 billion nuts in the first five months of this year, the Central Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Sri Lanka produced 1.03 billion nuts in the January to May period in 1996, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
